          "p_needs_human": 1.0,
          "is_safe_to_drive": 1,
          "needs_human": 0,
          "why": "stranded on a highway"
        },
        {
          "id": "sev-03",
          "text": "The brakes just failed on me, I had to pull over onto the verge.",
